e one of: otlp/grpc, otlp/http\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n- [ ] **Step 2: Run `terraform fmt -check`** (or `terraform fmt -check -recursive`). Exit 0 expected.\n\n- [ ] **Step 3: Run `terraform validate`** (or `terraform init -backend=false && terraform validate`). Should still pass — these are additive variables with safe defaults.\n\n   Note: Terraform 1.9.0+ may be needed. Use `mise exec terraform@1.9.0 -- terraform <cmd>` if the default `terraform` is older.\n\n## Constraints\n\n- **DO NOT run any git commands.** No `git add`, `git commit`, branch operations, etc. The user handles git manually and will manage rebasing onto a v1.0.5 feature branch.\n- **DO NOT** push, tag, or open MRs.\n- **DO NOT** run `terraform apply`, `kubectl`, `helm install`.\n- **DO NOT** modify any other files in this task — only `variables.tf`.\n\n## Spec / plan references\n\n- Spec: `/Users/steve.briggs/projects/IAC/docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-05-vector-redaction-design.md` §3.1\n- Plan: `/Users/steve.briggs/projects/IAC/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-05-vector-redaction-pipeline.md` Task B3\n\n## Report Format\n\n- **Status:** DONE | DONE_WITH_CONCERNS | BLOCKED | NEEDS_CONTEXT\n- Lines added to `variables.tf` (line numbers)\n- `terraform fmt -check` result\n- `terraform validate` result\n- Self-review findings"},"uuid":"e4265ab7-d653-42eb-84b4-33f25db77631","timestamp":"2026-05-05T18:09:17.357Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/steve.briggs/projects/IAC/terraform/internal-modules/kubernetes/monitoring/vector","sessionId":"9c7db84f-6d53-4918-8d06-638ada15b7e9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
